The evidence is consistent. I'm concluding with one root cause, at ts-preserve-service, and its propagation edge to ts-ui-dashboard.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-preserve-service",
      "fault_kind": "http_response_body_corrupted",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT p, service_name, span_name, attr_http_response_status_code code, count(*) c FROM (SELECT 'normal' p, * FROM normal_traces UNION ALL SELECT 'abnormal', * FROM abnormal_traces) WHERE service_name IN ('ts-security-service','ts-preserve-service') AND span_name IN ('GET /**','GET') GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY service_name, span_name, p",
          "claim": "Preserve's outgoing GET calls went from 200 (342 normal) to 404 (1603 abnormal); security's GET /** route now returns 404 for every request."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) c FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND span_name='POST /api/v1/preserveservice/preserve' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Ui-dashboard's preserve requests return 500 with Error status in 89 of 111 spans, versus 0 errors in normal."
        },
        {
          "kind": "log",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, level, attr_log_template, count(*) c FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name='ts-preserve-service' AND level='SEVERE' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Preserve logs a SEVERE dispatcher exception on all 1603 abnormal requests; no such entries appear in normal."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-preserve-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) c, avg(duration)/1e6 ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name IN ('ts-preserve-service','ts-ui-dashboard') AND span_name LIKE '%preserve%' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Preserve returns 500 Error on every request, and ui-dashboard's preserve spans show matching Error status with multi-second latency."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

